'''Odger's Hut''' is a Sub-[[Locations|Location]] inside the {{Zone|Crimson Isle}} that houses the NPC [[Odger]]. {{Zone|Odger's Hut}} sits near the top of the {{Zone|Blazing Volcano}}. During an eruption, it can still be accessed via a small back door from outside the volcano. 

{{ZoneText|Try to communicate with Odger.}}

== Appearance ==
A very small hut with obsidian and nether brick exterior with a black wool interior. The interior is lined with redstone lamps with a single window peeking out into some rocks.

